# long double for the runtime's C library, written in SemanticScript (D-174): the exact l-suffixed functions
# of math.h, done on the format's bits.
#
# This module is generated from tools/clong.dsl by tools/build.py.

clong is module
clong purpose "long double for the runtime's C library: the exact l-suffixed functions of math.h, done on the format's bits (D-174)"
